azione. Suo padre assume Sebastián Moore come sua guardia del corpo. I due vengono obbligati a passare ogni minuto insieme e tra loro si accende una passione inevitabile in un mondo in cui niente è ciò che sembra. Tratto dal romanzo di Mercedes Ron, autrice della saga Culpables."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Drawn Together","overview":"Marfil, daughter of a powerful Spanish businessman, sees her life in New York turned upside down when she is kidnapped and released without explanation. Her father hires Sebastian Moore as bodyguard and, forced to spend every minute together, an inevitable attraction ignites in a world where nothing is as it seems."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Parte 1 de la saga Enfrentados. Marfil, hija de un poderoso empresario español, ve cómo su vida en Nueva York da un vuelco al ser secuestrada y liberada sin explicación. Su padre contrata a Sebastian Moore como guardaespaldas y, forzados a pasar cada minuto juntos, surgirá una irremediable atracción en un mundo donde nada es lo que parece. Basada en la novela de Mercedes Ron, saga Culpables","tagline":"Cuando vendes tu alma al diablo, enamorarte de un ángel puede llevarte derecho al infierno."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4g7RSF7YcH1pvSv67CgMwFVVVY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i65y7cMae36K0giN0GRaMjAHUru.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1440098,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4g7RSF7YcH1pvSv67CgMwFVVVY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w4g7RSF7YcH1pvSv67CgMwFVVVY.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4g7RSF7YcH1pvSv67CgMwFVVVY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w4g7RSF7YcH1pvSv67CgMwFVVVY.